{"title":"Gem Onyx","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Warchief Ruk Gorehand, Ogre Elder, Ogre Butcher, Gaunt Ogre, Bogling +10 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-warchief\" title=\"Warchief Ruk Gorehand - dropped it in 10 of 181 looted corpses (1/18)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9fdec8d1ac3c9d7ac8df.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Warchief Ruk Gorehand</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/18<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"orc-grunt\" title=\"Orc Grunt - dropped it in 1 of 25 looted corpses (1/25)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9c694d24818e1e184cda.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Orc Grunt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/25<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-carver\" title=\"Gutrot The Carver - dropped it in 1 of 182 looted corpses (1/182)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/1f884f2242ac6c9d138c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gutrot The Carver</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/182<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh\" title=\"Virikh - dropped it in 1 of 197 looted corpses (1/197)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4dbed39ea4505123159.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/197<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+11 more\">+11 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"virikh-templar\" title=\"Virikh Templar - dropped it in 1 of 222 looted corpses (1/222)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7c6325d168ea4e24bc71.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Virikh Templar</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/222<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - dropped it in 1 of 300 looted corpses (1/300)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/300<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 4 of 1,732 looted corpses (1/433)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/433<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-gaunt\" title=\"Gaunt Ogre - dropped it in 2 of 868 looted corpses (1/434)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/97882a8de7cbdb0222cc.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gaunt Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/434<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 3 of 1,548 looted corpses (1/516)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/516<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"young-red-dragon\" title=\"Young Red Dragon - dropped it in 1 of 892 looted corpses (1/892)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/d3b91d3cbc801eda1dc2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Young Red Dragon</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/892<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 1 of 914 looted corpses (1/914)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/914<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 1 of 1,012 looted corpses (1/1,012)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,012<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"bogling\" title=\"Bogling - dropped it in 1 of 1,171 looted corpses (1/1,171)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/40fefc5bf6085eae0053.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Bogling</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,171<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"thak-footman\" title=\"Thak Footman - dropped it in 1 of 1,206 looted corpses (1/1,206)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/7bd0bd081dd39324d454.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Thak Footman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,206<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 1 of 2,837 looted corpses (1/2,837)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/2,837<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"gem-onyx\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/gems\">Gems</a></p>\n      \n      <h2>Carats</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Carat\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx\">All</a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=0.5\">0.5c <span>75</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1\">1c <span>19</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1.5\">1.5c <span>16</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-ordinary\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2\">2c <span>8</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on q-good\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2.5\">2.5c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-excellent\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3\">3c <span>2</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-superior\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3.5\">3.5c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4\">4c <span>1</span></a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4.5\">4.5c</a><a class=\"q-chip q-flawless\" href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=5\">5c</a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">Gems come in half-carat steps from 0.5c to 5c. Up to 2c counts as common. The witch can build up to 3c (one 3c takes 243 small gems); 3.5c and up only come from finds, 4c and up are very rare, and 4.5c and 5c only come from gathering. A ring needs at least 1c, counts whole carats and holds 4c at most.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Carat</th><th>Rarity</th><th>Onyx found</th><th>Of all gems found</th><th>How you get one</th><th>In a ring (Brawler)</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=0.5\" title=\"Show the 0.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.65)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">0.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>75 <span class=\"muted\">(60%)</span></td><td>62%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 10+</td><td>—</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1\" title=\"Show the 1c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.70)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>19 <span class=\"muted\">(15%)</span></td><td>16%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 20+, the witch (3 × 0.5c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Brawler: 1.5% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=1.5\" title=\"Show the 1.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.75)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">1.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>16 <span class=\"muted\">(13%)</span></td><td>10%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 30+, the witch (3 × 1c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Brawler: 1.5% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2\" title=\"Show the 2c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini \" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.80)\"><span class=\"q-name q-ordinary\">2c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-common\">common</span></td>\n      <td>8 <span class=\"muted\">(6.5%)</span></td><td>5.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 40+, the witch (3 × 1.5c, 2,500 gold) or a reagent at the witch</td><td>Brawler: 3% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=2.5\" title=\"Show the 2.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-good\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.85)\"><span class=\"q-name q-good\">2.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-uncommon\">uncommon</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(1.6%)</span></td><td>2.3%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 45+ or the witch (3 × 2c, 5,000 gold, after her quest Swallowed Stones)</td><td>Brawler: 3% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3\" title=\"Show the 3c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-excellent\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.90)\"><span class=\"q-name q-excellent\">3c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-semi-rare\">semi-rare</span></td>\n      <td>2 <span class=\"muted\">(1.6%)</span></td><td>2.2%</td>\n      <td>Gathering, monsters level 50+ or the witch (3 × 2.5c, 10,000 gold, after her quest Dragon’s Hoard)</td><td>Brawler: 4.5% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=3.5\" title=\"Show the 3.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-superior\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(0.95)\"><span class=\"q-name q-superior\">3.5c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-rare\">rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(0.8%)</span></td><td>0.9%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 55+</td><td>Brawler: 4.5% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4\" title=\"Show the 4c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style=\"transform:scale(1.00)\"><span class=\"q-name q-flawless\">4c</span></td><td><span class=\"tag-chip rar-very-rare\">very rare</span></td>\n      <td>1 <span class=\"muted\">(0.8%)</span></td><td>0.6%</td>\n      <td>Gathering or monsters level 55+</td><td>Brawler: 6% more melee damage dealt</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row\" data-href=\"#/item/gem-onyx?q=4.5\" title=\"Show the 4.5c one\"><td><img class=\"q-mini q-glow-flawless\" src=\"data/img/5436366be6d507c1b220.svg\" alt=\"\" style